PianoRiddle INMP441 CAL LOGGER (fat CSV, enter-per-key)
Set Serial Monitor: 921600 baud
INMP441: BCLK=26 LRCLK=25 DIN=33 shift>>8 left_only
DSP: fs=22050 N=4096 hop=256 (~86.1 Hz logs) df=5.3833Hz f=[20.0..4000.0]
Cal: keys=85 dur_ms=10000 next_key=0 peaks=8
Commands:
  cal              -> start calibration (prints header, then prompts keys)
  print            -> print summary (lines per key)
  dur <ms>         -> set per-key duration (e.g. dur 10000)
  hop <n>          -> set hop samples (128/256/512). smaller=faster logs
  peaks <n>        -> set peak count (1..8) (note: header fixed for 8)
  frange <min> <max> -> set F_MIN/F_MAX (e.g. frange 20 4000)
  startkey <idx>   -> set next key index (e.g. startkey 0)
  info             -> print config

While calibrating: press ENTER (empty line) to capture the prompted key.
